      "procedure": "Held-out ids are the task_idx values every measured arm of the published study scored, adopted verbatim and served in ascending order. The pool is the remaining 480 of 600, shuffled once with the recorded seed to fix the rollout's serving order.",
      "id_meaning": "A shogym automationbench task_id is the stringified index into the env's 600 tasks, which is the same integer the study recorded as task_idx.",
